 "category": "grotto",
 "category_zh": "石窟艺术",
 "category_en": "Grotto art",
 "intro_zh": "云冈石窟依山开凿，规模恢弘，气势雄浑，东西绵延约1公里，现存主要洞窟45个，重点洞窟有石鼓洞、寒泉洞、灵岩寺洞、大佛洞等；主要景观有石佛古寺、莲花大道、比丘尼昙媚造像记、礼佛浮雕墙、礼佛大道、昙曜广场等。2001年12月被联合国教科文组织批准列入世界文化遗产名录。",
 "intro_en": "The Yungang Grottoes are excavated on the mountain, with a large scale and majestic momentum. They stretch for about 1 kilometer from east to west. There are 45 major caves in existence. The key caves include Shigu Cave, Hanquan Cave, Lingyan Temple Cave, Big Buddha Cave, etc.; the main landscapes include the Stone Buddha Temple, Lotus Avenue, Bhikshuni Tanmei Statue, Buddha Relief Wall, Buddha Avenue, Tan Yao Square, etc. In December 2001, it was approved by UNESCO to be included in the World Cultural Heritage List.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
